sequenceDiagram

    participant Client as React Client
    participant API as Reservation API
    participant Redis
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant Kafka
    participant Worker as Storage Worker

    Client->>API: POST /api/reservations + JWT

    API->>API: Validate JWT
    API->>API: Extract CustomerId from token

    API->>Redis: Acquire table/time lock

    alt Lock unavailable
        Redis-->>API: Lock rejected
        API-->>Client: 409 Conflict
    else Lock acquired
        Redis-->>API: Lock accepted

        API->>Mongo: Insert reservation

        alt Duplicate reservation
            Mongo-->>API: Duplicate key
            API-->>Client: 409 Conflict
        else Reservation stored
            Mongo-->>API: Insert successful

            API->>Kafka: Publish ReservationCreated event

            API-->>Client: 202 Accepted

            Kafka->>Worker: Deliver reservation event

            Worker->>Mongo: Upsert reservation by Id
            Worker->>Redis: Cache reservation for 24 hours
            Worker->>Kafka: Commit message offset
        end
    end